{"id":"n89858-5-7","stage":0,"title":"되다 · 为","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89858-5-7-1","ko":"아저씨, 요금이 얼마예요?","zh":"大叔，费用是多少？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아저씨,","meaning":"大叔，叔叔","explanation":"아저씨：大叔，叔叔。","readings":[{"term":"아저씨","audio":"/audio/14cf4d2fee0defcf1f6b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26237","senseId":"2","lemma":"아저씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아저씨","audio":"/audio/14cf4d2fee0defcf1f6b.mp3"}},{"text":"요금이","meaning":"费用，收费，资费","explanation":"요금：费用，收费，资费；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"요금","audio":"/audio/b79f7bdaa9ffe6aedfbf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67863","senseId":"1","lemma":"요금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요금이","audio":"/audio/bdcb297d8d3aaa13cae3.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마예요?","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마：多少；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마예요","audio":"/audio/74f61b058b435e5ecaf9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"14cf4d2fee0defcf","term":"아저씨","zh":"大叔，叔叔","audio":"/audio/14cf4d2fee0defcf1f6b.mp3","entryId":"26237","definition":"陌生人之间用于指称或称呼没有老的成年男子。","pronunciation":["아저씨"]},{"id":"b79f7bdaa9ffe6ae","term":"요금","zh":"费用，收费，资费","audio":"/audio/b79f7bdaa9ffe6aedfbf.mp3","entryId":"67863","definition":"使用设施或参观而支付的钱。","pronunciation":["요ː금"]},{"id":"8e0a4529e0c9d4ed","term":"얼마","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3","entryId":"29750","definition":"不知道的数量、价值、程度。","pronunciation":["얼마"]}],"audio":"/audio/40682e34bb3ee723a162.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89858-5-7-2","ko":"요금은 모두 만 원이 되겠습니다.","zh":"费用一共一万韩元。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요금은","meaning":"费用，收费，资费","explanation":"요금：费用，收费，资费；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요금","audio":"/audio/b79f7bdaa9ffe6aedfbf.mp3"}],"sources":